  ],
  "limitations": ["Cross-species proximity is evidence of shared state, not proof of cellular homology. Orthology databases and protein embeddings are release-dependent. SAMap requires sequence-derived maps; SATURN is compute-intensive and sensitive to protein embeddings; CAME is pairwise. Species-specific states must not be forced into reference labels."],
